Let P, n ∈ ℕ. Let U ⊆ ℝ^P be open, V ⊆ U open (hVU : V ⊆ U), and K ⊆ ℝ^P compact with K ⊆ V. Let X ∈ 𝒟_n(V) (GeometricCurrentOn V n), and let R = (M, θ, ξ) be an IMRep in V (contract structure IMRep V n) representing X, i.e. X(ω) = ∫_M θ⟨ω, ξ⟩ dHⁿ for every ω ∈ 𝒟ⁿ(V). Assume Hⁿ(M ∖ K) = 0, where Hⁿ = μHE[n]. Then there is Y ∈ 𝒟_n(U) such that:
(i) Y.restrictDomain hVU = X, i.e. Y(ιω) = X(ω) for every ω ∈ 𝒟ⁿ(V), where ι = testFormOnInclusion hVU regards a test form in V as one in U;
(ii) spt Y ⊆ K (GeometricCurrentOn.support, Simon 6.2.11);
(iii) spt Y is compact;
(iv) if ∂X = 0 in V (contract BoundaryVanishes X; vacuous for n = 0), then ∂Y = 0 in U;
(v) Y is integer multiplicity (contract IsIntegerMultiplicity).
This is the comparator-accepted DAG declaration dtc_extend_by_zero (node root.density_and_tangent_cones-a1.localize-a1.extend_by_zero-a1, candidate 2527748da70b09774a09fb289587a318d32d7832), reused with its identical frozen Lean type. The parent applies it with U := ℝ^P (univ) and V := U.
